 parts.append('</table></div><h3>Runoff / 预付款流失</h3><p>50%: EUR 726.956635 / share; 100%: EUR 707.941576 / share. Same dated bridge / 相同日期资本桥。</p><h3>Future grant cost / 未来授予成本</h3><p>0.75%: EV EUR 282,743.557609m; 1.5%: EV EUR 277,247.309292m. Residual costs and explicit investment fixed; terminal investment follows NOPAT / 残余成本及明确投资固定，终值投资随 NOPAT 变化。</p></section>')
 parts.append('<section><h2>Curated history / 整理历史 · EURm 百万欧元</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><tr><th>Fiscal end / 财年末</th><th>Revenue / 收入</th><th>Reported EBIT / 报告 EBIT</th><th>Normalized EBIT / 规范 EBIT</th></tr>')
